/-
# `Work.FoldInst`: the `M̄` instantiation of the fold charts

Aggregate import for the area.  `import Submission.Work.FoldInst.All` gives the whole chapter.

## The space `M̄`

* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Data` (generated by `gen_data.py`): the 24 side normals, the 24
  truncation normals, the five side types, the side/vertex permutation tables, and the 98 fold
  classes (`foldCodim`, `foldWall`, `foldTriple`, `foldWallPos`, `foldTau`, `foldN2`, and the
  representative data `foldRepCopy/D/K/Eps`).
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Basic`: the constraints (`sideSlack`, `truncSlack`), the truncated
  24-cell `Qbar`, the group `Gg = (Fin 4 → ZMod 2) × ZMod 2`, the sign-change action `act`, the
  permutations `sidePerm`/`truncPerm`, the types `sideType`, the identification group `Ksub`, and
  the accessors of the fold data.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Cert`/`CertFold` (generated): the finite certificates, including the
  fold identity `N_F D_r K_r = R_{ε_r} N_F`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Polytope`: `Q̄` is invariant under the sign changes; the slack
  transport and `Ksub_act`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Qbar_geometry`: `Q̄` is compact, convex, closed, nonempty, in the ball.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Action`, `Continuous`: `Xbar = ZMod 2 × Q̄`, `actX`, continuity.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Atlas`: the relation `~₁`, its equivalence structure, and the class
  atlas `classAtlas : QuotientT2.ClassAtlas Xbar`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Quotient`: **`Mbar = Xbar/~₁`** with `T2Space`, `CompactSpace`,
  `T1Space`, the openness/closedness criteria, and the closed truncation set `Tset`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Connected`: **`ConnectedSpace Mbar`**.

## The fold charts

* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.Voronoi`: the fold pieces `Dvor i r` (the blueprint's Voronoi
  chambers, truncations included) and `foldPsi`, `foldPhi`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.CertFlip`: the flip certificates (single step, root representative,
  distinct walls, same copy + same walls).
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.fold_state_flipSet`, `actX_image_Dvor`, `Dvor_disjoint`,
  `Ksub_eq_wallSum`: the action of the wall group on the pieces.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.foldTheta_flip`, `foldTheta_injOn`, `fold_theta_coord`,
  `fold_theta_orthant`: the algebra of the chart map `θ`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.fold_chart_of_glued`: the generic chart-from-glued-map lemma.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.foldPsi_eq`, `foldPsi_hagree`, `foldPsi_hcross`,
  `foldPsi_continuousOn`, `isOpen_foldTheta_image`, `htarget_open`, `foldPhi_mk`,
  `foldPhi_continuousOn`, `exists_foldChart`: the fold chart of a face class.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.fold_source_open_dvor`: the source of the chart is open (and
  saturated).
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.CoverData` (generated by `gen_cover.py`), `Cover`:
  **`cover_foldCharts`**, every point of `M̄ ∖ Tset` lies in the source of a fold chart.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.FoldChart`: the interface for `Space/` — `foldChart i` (an
  `OpenPartialHomeomorph Mbar E4`), `foldChart_source`, `foldChart_apply`, `foldChart_symm_apply`,
  `foldChart_source_disjoint_Tset`, `iUnion_foldChart_source`, `mem_foldChart_source`.
* `Submission.Work.FoldInst.FoldInvDefs`, `foldInv_foldTheta`, `continuousOn_foldInv`,
  `contDiffOn_foldTheta`, `foldPsi_image_reflVec`, `Qbar_of_mem_VoronoiOpen_root`,
  `exists_pos_le_foldTheta_height`: the inverse chart map `foldInv i r` (the Klein point with
  `foldTheta i r (foldInv i r z) = z`) and the analytic facts about the charts (continuity,
  smoothness, the height bound `δ`).
-/
